# Accessibility

- Skip link + `main` landmark; one `h1`
- Keyboard operable; visible focus
- Contrast AA minimum
- **`prefers-reduced-motion`:** disable Lenis smooth, cinematic pins/scrubs, boot theater, decorative Three — show static finals
- WebGL/canvas never sole carrier of critical information
- Meaningful custom video: captions/transcript when we host the file
- Touch targets usable on mobile; no hover-only essential actions
- Decorative motion: `aria-hidden` where appropriate
